
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#111827">
  <title>NovaCart India | Everyday Finds</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Discover useful gadgets, everyday essentials and smart finds at NovaCart India.">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #18212f;
      background: #f7f8fa;
    }
    header {
      background: #111827;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px 6%;
    }
    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .logo { font-size: 25px; font-weight: 800; }
    .logo span { color: #67e8c0; }
    .nav a { color: white; text-decoration: none; }
    .hero {
      padding: 65px 6%;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #d1fae5, #eff6ff);
    }
    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 650px;
      font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 60px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }
    .hero p {
      max-width: 520px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #465366;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #111827;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    main { padding: 35px 6% 60px; }
    .section-heading { margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .section-heading h2 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .section-heading p { color: #687386; }
    .products {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .product-art {
      min-height: 180px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: #edf2f7;
      font-size: 70px;
    }
    .card-content { padding: 18px; }
    .card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .card p { color: #687386; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; }
    .price { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; }
    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #d1fae5;
      color: #065f46;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .note {
      margin-top: 30px;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    footer {
      padding: 25px 6%;
      background: #111827;
      color: #d1d5db;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    footer a { color: #a7f3d0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="logo">NovaCart<span>.</span></div>
      <a href="#products">Explore products ↓</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <span class="tag">WELCOME TO NOVACART</span>
    <h1>Discover smarter everyday finds.</h1>
    <p>
      Explore useful gadgets, everyday essentials and clever
      finds designed to make daily life a little easier.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="#products">Explore the collection</a>
  </section>

  <main>
    <section id="products">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Explore our collection</h2>
        <p>These are sample product concepts. Real products and prices will be added after supplier checks.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="products">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true">🎧</div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="tag">SAMPLE</span>
            <h3>Everyday Audio</h3>
            <p>Discover audio accessories for work, study and leisure.</p>
            <div class="price">Price coming soon</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true">💡</div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="tag">SAMPLE</span>
            <h3>Smart Lighting</h3>
            <p>Explore practical lighting ideas for your desk and room.</p>
            <div class="price">Price coming soon</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true">🎒</div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="tag">SAMPLE</span>
            <h3>Daily Essentials</h3>
            <p>Browse useful accessories for college and everyday life.</p>
            <div class="price">Price coming soon</div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="note">
      <strong>Launching soon</strong>
      <p>
        We're preparing our first collection. Product availability,
        prices, delivery details and ordering information will be
        published once confirmed.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <strong>NovaCart India</strong><br>
    An independent online store project.<br>
    Contact and ordering details will be added before launch.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
